ousing Discrimination Assistance','Thurston']::text[], 'discrimination complaints accepted by washington state human rights commission legal aid enforces state law regarding people who were discriminated against because of their protected status includes those who believe they were unfairly denied a reasonable accommodation related to a vaccine mandate 711 capitol way south suite 402 olympia thurston 98501 constitutional civil rights groups education discrimination assistance health care discrimination assistance employment discrimination assistance customer service discrimination assistance credit denial assistance housing discrimination assistance', 'hum.wa.gov', 0, 0, 'discrimination-complaints-accepted-by-washington-state-human-rights-commission-olympia-aba77ac6');
